WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
You're a builder.

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.800
Your crew should be building.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.800
Not calling 10 suppliers.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.800
Not waiting for callbacks.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.800
Not chasing what's in stock.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.800
Missing materials stop the job.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:13.800
Idle crews cost money.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.800
Send us one request.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.700
We source. Compare. Coordinate.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.000
You build. We handle the materials.
